ata pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"floors\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Floors</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">6</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"rooms\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Rooms</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">9</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Other</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"implemented\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Version</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">10.50<br/><span class=\"implementation-date\">July 7, 2014<br/>Summer Update 2014</span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"status\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Status</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Active</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\"><p>\t    See also: Buildings <span class=\"explained\">Help</span></p></nav>\n</aside>\n<div id=\"w-house-furnishings\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Furnishings\">Furnishings</span></h3>\n<p>Rosetta Windows, Astro Clock, Huge Telescope, Armillary Sphere, Luxurious Couch, Big Venorean Table, Venorean Stools, Ornate Carpet, Ficus Benjamina, 4 Shadowy Statues, Candle (Double)s, Large Book\n</p>\n</div>\n<div id=\"w-house-location\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Location\">Location</span></h3>\n<div class=\"map_image\" style=\"width:150px;display:inline-block;position: relative;\"><img alt=\"75?cb=20260713145733&amp;path-prefix=en&amp;format=original\" class=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Minimap_Floor_5_d2c888.png\"/>\n<div style=\"border-right: 1px dashed white;position: absolute;height: 100%;width: 50.6%;top: 0px;display: block;\"></div>\n<div style=\"border-bottom: 1px dashed white;position: absolute;height: 50%;width: 100%;top: 0px;display: block;\"></div>\n</div><div class=\"minimap_clic\" style=\"width:152px;display:block;text-align:right;font-size:14px\">\n<a class=\"coord-link\" data-coord=\"33662,31884,5\" title=\"Ver no mapa\">Browse Map (33662, 31884, 5)</a></div>\n<p>Northern part of Upper <a href=\"#/wiki/Rathleton\">Rathleton</a>\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-house-notes\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Notes\">Notes</span></h3>\n<dl><dd></dd></dl>\n<p>In the Magistrate the voting process takes place. Citizens of <a href=\"#/wiki/Rathleton\">Rathleton</a> can cast votes on different subjects. There is also a <a href=\"#/wiki/Slime%20Slide\">Slime Slide</a> to a hunting ground filled with various creatures, depending on what the majority voted on in the previous weeks. You can find the following NPCs in the Magistrate:\n</p>\n<ul><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Ezebeth\">Ezebeth</a>, +2 (at building entrance)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Marvin\">Marvin</a>, +2 (entrance level)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Barazbaz\">Barazbaz</a>, +2 (entrance level)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Jondrin\">Jondrin</a>, +3</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Sholley\">Sholley</a>, +4</li></ul>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div class=\"navigation\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Related_Rathleton_Magistrate_Plaza_Buildings\">Related Rathleton Magistrate Plaza Buildings</span></h3>\n<div class=\"navigation-body navigation-list-wrapper\"><p class=\"no-results\">There are no results matching these parameters.</p></div>\n</div>\n<p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n</div></div></div>","quests":["dark-trails-quest","oramond-quest","rathleton-quest"]}